{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/tools/layout,_N_T_/tools/[category]/layout,_N_T_/tools/[category]/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/tools/[category]/[slug]/page,_N_T_/tools/image/screenshot-cleaner"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/tools/$d$category/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/tools/$d$category/$d$slug","/tools/$d$category","/tools","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" class=\"geist_29008ace-module__qpOSqq__variable geist_mono_376e4c3c-module__Cf8Oda__variable\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0hwforhb7bb2y.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3f7c1u3y47an2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1gb6e7-1asl9f.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1fj6kbkj_syo6.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3j9pm5otqxm82.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-2kgwj_ji4063t.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/119u6-1buly1t.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1xk9sgipyme72.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-DBZT1K0P01\" as=\"script\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Screenshot Beautifier - Wrap Screenshots in Beautiful Gradients | Creators Units</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Beautify screenshots for App Store or social media. Add smooth card container margins, gradients, mock shadows, and custom paddings.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Creators Units\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"creator tools, image compressor, qr generator, youtube tag extractor, text case converter, fancy text generator, link in bio\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/image/screenshot-cleaner\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Screenshot Beautifier - Wrap Screenshots in Beautiful Gradients | Creators Units\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Beautify screenshots for App Store or social media. Add smooth card container margins, gradients, mock shadows, and custom paddings.\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Screenshot Beautifier - Creators Units\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Screenshot Beautifier - Wrap Screenshots in Beautiful Gradients | Creators Units\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Beautify screenshots for App Store or social media. Add smooth card container margins, gradients, mock shadows, and custom paddings.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Creators Units\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com\",\"logo\":\"https://creatorunits.com/logo.png\",\"description\":\"Free, fast, and privacy-focused online tools for creators, freelancers, and small businesses.\",\"sameAs\":[],\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer service\",\"email\":\"support@creatorunits.com\",\"availableLanguage\":\"English\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"Creators Units\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com\",\"description\":\"Free online tools for creators, freelancers, and small businesses.\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script>\n              (function() {\n                try {\n                  const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme');\n                  const systemPrefersDark = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;\n                  const theme = savedTheme || (systemPrefersDark ? 'dark' : 'light');\n                  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\n                } catch (e) {}\n              })();\n            </script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div style=\"visibility:hidden\" class=\"page-wrapper\"><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-to-content\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"Screenshot Beautifier\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/image/screenshot-cleaner\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilityApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"All\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires HTML5, Javascript, Canvas\",\"description\":\"Transform raw screenshots into beautiful, shareable marketing graphics with margins and shadow.\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a screenshot beautifier?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A screenshot beautifier is a creative tool that transforms plain, raw screenshots into professional marketing graphics. By placing your screenshot inside a clean container, adding custom padding, wrapping it in colorful gradient backgrounds, and applying drop shadows, it creates high-quality visuals for social media or app stores. It turns ordinary captures into eye-catching assets.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why should I improve screenshots before sharing?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Raw screenshots can look boring, flat, and hard to distinguish from background text in articles. Improving them with gradients and shadows adds professional polish, increases visual engagement, makes UI elements pop, and elevates your overall content branding across social feeds, blogs, and marketing decks. Polished screenshots are far more likely to grab attention and get shared.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I add spacing and shadows?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes! Our beautifier allows you to adjust the spacing (padding) surrounding your screenshot and customize the depth of the drop shadow. You can choose from soft, realistic shadows to heavy, retro designs, creating depth that separates your UI mockups from the background canvas. These small details make your screenshots look polished and professional.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it useful for tutorials and blogs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Absolutely. Bloggers, technical writers, and tutorial creators use this tool to highlight code snippets, dashboard screens, or mobile app features. Wrapping screenshots in a consistent style makes tutorial pages look clean, cohesive, and significantly more professional for readers. It helps your instructional content stand out from competing articles.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can screenshots be optimized for social media?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, our tool includes standard aspect ratio options like 1:1 square for Instagram or 16:9 widescreen for X (formerly Twitter) and LinkedIn. This allows you to fit screenshots to platform templates, ensuring your visual marketing assets display perfectly in user feeds. No more guessing dimensions or dealing with cropped-off content.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Image Tools\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/category/image\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Screenshot Beautifier\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/image/screenshot-cleaner\"}]}</script><header class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__header\" role=\"banner\"><div class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__nav container\"><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__logo\" aria-label=\"Creators Units - Go to homepage\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__logoIcon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__logoText\">Creators Units</span></a><nav class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__menu\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link Header-module__lnUIdW__linkActive\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/tools\">Explore Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/category/image\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/category/creator\">Creator Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/category/social\">Social Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/category/utility\">Utility Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__actions\"><button class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__themeToggle\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" title=\"Toggle to dark theme\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__menuToggle\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"main-content section\" id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:0.85rem\"><ol style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;align-items:center\"><li><a style=\"color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin:0 0.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">/</li><li><a style=\"color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/category/image\">Image Tools</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin:0 0.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">/</li><li aria-current=\"page\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:600\">Screenshot Beautifier</li></ol></nav><div style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.25rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Screenshot Beautifier</h1><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:0\">Transform raw screenshots into beautiful, shareable marketing graphics with margins and shadow.</p></div><section style=\"margin-bottom:3rem\" aria-label=\"Screenshot Beautifier tool interface\"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--></section><div class=\"grid-cols-2\" style=\"gap:2rem;margin-bottom:3rem\"><div class=\"card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">📋 How to Use</h2><ol style=\"padding-left:1.25rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.9rem\"><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Drag and drop your raw application screenshot.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Customize padding size, container border-radius, and background styles (gradients/solids).</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Adjust the depth of the box-shadow.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Download the high-quality, sharing-ready PNG.</li></ol></div><div class=\"card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">⚡ Key Features</h2><ul style=\"padding-left:1.25rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.9rem;list-style-type:square\"><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Polished Mock Frame: Wraps screenshots in a clean card border.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Gradient Backdrops: Custom rich backgrounds.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Shadow Depth Settings: Adjust graphic depth controls.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Aspect Ratio Control: Fit 1:1, 16:9, or free forms.</li></ul></div></div><section class=\"card\" style=\"background-color:var(--bg-primary);padding:2.5rem;margin-bottom:3.5rem\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">Turn Raw Screenshots into Marketing Assets</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\">Raw screenshots can look flat and uninspiring when shared on social media or pitch decks. Our Screenshot Beautifier wraps your images in elegant layouts with modern gradients and soft shadows.</p><div style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem\">\n<h3>Making Screenshots Stand Out</h3>\n<p>By putting screenshots on a colorful gradient background with custom padding and realistic shadows, you create separation between the screenshot and its canvas container. This makes UI elements pop and feel like polished developer product updates.</p>\n    </div></section><section style=\"margin-bottom:3.5rem\" aria-labelledby=\"tool-faq-heading\"><h2 id=\"tool-faq-heading\" class=\"text-center mb-6\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto\"><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">What is a screenshot beautifier?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">A screenshot beautifier is a creative tool that transforms plain, raw screenshots into professional marketing graphics. By placing your screenshot inside a clean container, adding custom padding, wrapping it in colorful gradient backgrounds, and applying drop shadows, it creates high-quality visuals for social media or app stores. It turns ordinary captures into eye-catching assets.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Why should I improve screenshots before sharing?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Raw screenshots can look boring, flat, and hard to distinguish from background text in articles. Improving them with gradients and shadows adds professional polish, increases visual engagement, makes UI elements pop, and elevates your overall content branding across social feeds, blogs, and marketing decks. Polished screenshots are far more likely to grab attention and get shared.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Can I add spacing and shadows?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Yes! Our beautifier allows you to adjust the spacing (padding) surrounding your screenshot and customize the depth of the drop shadow. You can choose from soft, realistic shadows to heavy, retro designs, creating depth that separates your UI mockups from the background canvas. These small details make your screenshots look polished and professional.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Is it useful for tutorials and blogs?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Absolutely. Bloggers, technical writers, and tutorial creators use this tool to highlight code snippets, dashboard screens, or mobile app features. Wrapping screenshots in a consistent style makes tutorial pages look clean, cohesive, and significantly more professional for readers. It helps your instructional content stand out from competing articles.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Can screenshots be optimized for social media?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Yes, our tool includes standard aspect ratio options like 1:1 square for Instagram or 16:9 widescreen for X (formerly Twitter) and LinkedIn. This allows you to fit screenshots to platform templates, ensuring your visual marketing assets display perfectly in user feeds. No more guessing dimensions or dealing with cropped-off content.</p></details></div></section><section style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-color);padding-top:3rem\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"mb-6\">Related <!-- -->Image Tools</h2><div class=\"grid-cols-4\"><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Open Image Compressor - Compress PNG, JPG, and WebP images directly in your browser without losing quality.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-compressor\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">Image Compressor</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical\">Compress PNG, JPG, and WebP images directly in your browser without losing quality.</p></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Open Image Resizer - Resize images to custom pixel dimensions or preset percentages with aspect ratio lock.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-resizer\"><h3 s