ial media. Add smooth card container margins, gradients, mock shadows, and custom paddings.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"17\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg\"}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"19\",{}]]\n","/tools/$d$category/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n8:I[3374,[\"/_next/static/chunks/119u6-1buly1t.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xk9sgipyme72.js\"],\"default\"]\n9:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/119u6-1buly1t.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xk9sgipyme72.js\"],\"\"]\na:I[36606,[\"/_next/static/chunks/119u6-1buly1t.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xk9sgipyme72.js\"],\"default\"]\nd:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/119u6-1buly1t.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\ne:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2:T992,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a screenshot beautifier?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A screenshot beautifier is a creative tool that transforms plain, raw screenshots into professional marketing graphics. By placing your screenshot inside a clean container, adding custom padding, wrapping it in colorful gradient backgrounds, and applying drop shadows, it creates high-quality visuals for social media or app stores. It turns ordinary captures into eye-catching assets.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why should I improve screenshots before sharing?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Raw screenshots can look boring, flat, and hard to distinguish from background text in articles. Improving them with gradients and shadows adds professional polish, increases visual engagement, makes UI elements pop, and elevates your overall content branding across social feeds, blogs, and marketing decks. Polished screenshots are far more likely to grab attention and get shared.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I add spacing and shadows?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes! Our beautifier allows you to adjust the spacing (padding) surrounding your screenshot and customize the depth of the drop shadow. You can choose from soft, realistic shadows to heavy, retro designs, creating depth that separates your UI mockups from the background canvas. These small details make your screenshots look polished and professional.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it useful for tutorials and blogs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Absolutely. Bloggers, technical writers, and tutorial creators use this tool to highlight code snippets, dashboard screens, or mobile app features. Wrapping screenshots in a consistent style makes tutorial pages look clean, cohesive, and significantly more professional for readers. It helps your instructional content stand out from competing articles.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can screenshots be optimized for social media?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, our tool includes standard aspect ratio options like 1:1 square for Instagram or 16:9 widescreen for X (formerly Twitter) and LinkedIn. This allows you to fit screenshots to platform templates, ensuring your visual marketing assets display perfectly in user feeds. No more guessing dimensions or dealing with cropped-off content.\"}}]}0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebApplication\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Screenshot Beautifier\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/image/screenshot-cleaner\\\",\\\"applicationCategory\\\":\\\"UtilityApplication\\\",\\\"operati